  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. Players alternate playing one card face up to a central pile.\n2. **Breakaway**: You create a breakaway if you play a card of the SAME rank as the card currently on top of the pile, OR if you play any **Jack**.\n3. **Scoring a Goal**: Once you have a breakaway, you score a goal if you match the NEXT card played by your opponent.\n4. **Defense/Saves**: If your opponent creates a breakaway, your current breakaway is cancelled. You can also 'save' a goal attempt by playing a card that your opponent cannot match.",
    Player: "1. Players alternate playing one card face up to a central pile.\n2. **Breakaway**: You create a breakaway if you play a card of the SAME rank as the card currently on top of the pile, OR if you play any **Jack**.\n3. **Scoring a Goal**: Once you have a breakaway, you score a goal if you match the NEXT card played by your opponent.\n4. **Defense/Saves**: If your opponent creates a breakaway, your current breakaway is cancelled. You can also 'save' a goal attempt by playing a card that your opponent cannot match.",
    objective: "Score more 'goals' than your opponent over three periods of play.",
    gameplay: "1. Players alternate playing one card face up to a central pile.\n2. **Breakaway**: You create a breakaway if you play a card of the SAME rank as the card currently on top of the pile, OR if you play any **Jack**.\n3. **Scoring a Goal**: Once you have a breakaway, you score a goal if you match the NEXT card played by your opponent.\n4. **Defense/Saves**: If your opponent creates a breakaway, your current breakaway is cancelled. You can also 'save' a goal attempt by playing a card that your opponent cannot match.",
